{"agent":"main","body":{"error":null,"exit":0,"for_seq":7,"result_bytes":489,"result_hash":"sha256:c513531d1c941417f0ea2c699df3040f9aaf5d65f6923520af80f3b2a5943437","result_inline":"src/pages.ts\ntest/pages.test.ts\nvendor/slugify/CHANGELOG.md\nvendor/slugify/index.ts\nvendor/README.md\n---README---\n# docsite-pages\n\nPage model for the documentation site. `pageSlug(title)` turns a page title into the URL segment; slugs are lowercase, hyphen separated and ASCII, and existing URLs must keep resolving.\n\nThird-party code lives under `vendor/` as exact copies of upstream releases (see `vendor/README.md`); `vendor/slugify` was bumped to 2.0.0 last week.\n\nNode 24, `npm test`.","served":"live","truncated":false,"wall_ms":0},"hash":"sha256:42c8c4413181eb49f6c5ac1bfb0e0e63619c840abc4b89d2593717e6139822b9","mono_ns":8000000,"prev":"sha256:756a6663c2699005413dc4afa7ef91e6c73be59988b4373937644c3d870bf543","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":8,"session":"9139e412-589e-41fd-8406-759534819e7e","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.008Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_result"}
